  "description": "Capital Heritage is a timeless vintage serif font inspired by classic Western signage, old book covers, heritage branding, and traditional typography. Featuring bold slab serif letterforms with clean lines and an authentic retro feel, this font is perfect for creating elegant logos, packaging, labels, posters, apparel, book covers, invitations, café branding, whiskey labels, and rustic-themed projects.\nIts strong vintage personality blends beautifully with minimalist layouts, making it suitable for both classic and modern designs. Whether you’re working on branding, print, Cricut crafts, laser cutting, or retro-inspired merchandise, Capital Heritage delivers a professional and memorable look.\nPerfect for logos, branding, posters, packaging, product labels, vintage signage, apparel designs, book covers, social media graphics, printable crafts, and many other creative projects.",
  "fullDescription": "<p>Capital Heritage is a timeless vintage serif font inspired by classic Western signage, old book covers, heritage branding, and traditional typography. Featuring bold slab serif letterforms with clean lines and an authentic retro feel, this font is perfect for creating elegant logos, packaging, labels, posters, apparel, book covers, invitations, café branding, whiskey labels, and rustic-themed projects.</p>\n<p>Its strong vintage personality blends beautifully with minimalist layouts, making it suitable for both classic and modern designs. Whether you’re working on branding, print, Cricut crafts, laser cutting, or retro-inspired merchandise, Capital Heritage delivers a professional and memorable look.</p>\n<p>Perfect for logos, branding, posters, packaging, product labels, vintage signage, apparel designs, book covers, social media graphics, printable crafts, and many other creative projects.</p>",
